		<title>Can psychopaths love?</title>
		<link>http://civgene.matthewnewhall.com/archives/69</link>
		<comments>http://civgene.matthewnewhall.com/archives/69#comments</comments>
		<pubDate>Wed, 02 Oct 2013 21:14:26 +0000</pubDate>
